# Firewall-Mon deployment overrides. Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and adjust.
# docker-compose auto-loads `.env` from the same directory; values referenced
# as ${VAR:-default} in docker-compose.yml pick up these settings.

# ---------- Data volume ----------
# Host path bind-mounted into the container at /data. This holds SQLite (dev)
# or the Postgres PGDATA (prod), plus the config-backup archive. Default in
# the compose file is a project-local ./data dir. Production should point
# this at a dedicated partition with adequate free space — the rust-01
# deployment outgrew the root volume in 2026-05 and was relocated to
# /mnt/STORAGE (see CHANGELOG v0.10.199).
#
# DATA_DIR=/mnt/STORAGE/firewall-mon-data
